# Java cyclomatic complexity verification

## Requirement

Apply the corporate cyclomatic complexity policy to Java methods using a declared analysis tool and its documented Java counting conventions. SonarQube is an initial candidate, not a normative dependency.

## Verification

Record per-method scores, the analyzer and version, configured threshold and exceptions. The approved per-method maximum is **10**. Findings above this value MUST fail the applicable QA Gate unless a documented exception has been approved.
